w: Hark! The her- ald an- gels sing, * "Glo- ry to the new- born King;
w: Christ, by high- est Heav'n a- dored; * Christ the ev- er- last- ing Lord;
w: Hail the heav'n- ly Prince of Peace! * Hail the Sun of Right- eous- ness!
w: Come, De- sire of na- tions, come, * Fix in us Thy hum- ble home;
w: Ad- am's like- ness, Lord, ef- face, * Stamp Thine im- age in its place:
